# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# This file is optional. The defaults work without it.
# Copy it to .env only when customization is needed. Do not commit .env.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional settings
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# WebAdmin and WebClient access on the Docker host.
# SFTPGO_WEB_BIND_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1
# SFTPGO_WEB_PORT=8080

# SFTP access on the Docker host. Use a trusted LAN address for LAN clients.
# SFTPGO_SFTP_BIND_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1
# SFTPGO_SFTP_PORT=2022

# Leave these lines commented to use Docker-managed named volumes.
# Enter absolute Linux host paths only when the host must access the files.
# The directories must be writable by UID and GID 1000.
# Changing a source does not move existing data and can change permissions,
# backup and restore behavior. Read the README before changing these values.
# SFTPGO_DATA_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/sftpgo-data
# SFTPGO_HOME_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/sftpgo-home
